      "english": "The trees have started to bud.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13995_mebuku_ex2",
      "japanese": "{春|はる}になると、{枯|か}れたように{見|み}えた{枝|えだ}から{新|あたら}しい{芽|め}が{芽吹|めぶ}く。",
      "english": "When spring comes, new buds sprout from branches that had looked dead.",
      "notes": null,
